<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Titus</book>
  <para style="h">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titus</para>
  <para style="mt">Titus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien’ nasem le Jesu Khris’ sawltahpi keima Paul in, Pasien’ teeltuom mite upna zieh le Pasien’ mi hina tawh kituoh thuman thutah ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zuouthu a gen ngai lo Pasien in leitung kipat masanga a ciemsa, kumtawn hinna lametna ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hun a tun ciengin eite’ Hundampa Pasien’ thupiehna tawh keima ei ki-ap tangkona tungtawnin ama’ thu hing kilangsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />eite in i neiton uh upna sungah ka tapa tahtah ahi Titus tungah lai kang hlah hi: Pa Pasien le i Hundampa Khris Jesu tung panin hepina le lungmuonna na tungah hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Crete tuikul ah kang nuasiena thu pen tam thu zieh ahi hi. Nangma na hile a kinuasie nasep bangsam teng na man sieng thei nading le kang lamlahsa bangin khuopi cin tengah hlattuom pawlpi upate se-in a koi ding na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua upa dingte pen paubanna a om lo mi, zi khatvei beh a nei mi hi ding a, a tate zong thu um mi hi-in, huasanin thu mang lo hi, ci-a a kimawsah lo mite hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile hlattuom pawlpi kem siepa pen Pasien’ neisa a kempa ahi ma bangin paubanna a nei lo mi hi ding hi; a kiphasah lo, a thangpai bai lo, zu a hai lo, mi tawh a kihau lo, a gamhtat lo, met nading sui-in a hawhdah lo mi hi ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuale mahin zindo siem mi, thuhoi dei mi, a pilvang mi, a pumpi ki-uh zo mi, a thutang mi, biehna lam a pawnthaw mi le a kideh zo mi hi pelmaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuhilna man tawh thu a hil thei nading le thuman a nielte a thuh thei nadingin ama in thuhilna dung zui-in a muontah thu a tukip mi hi pelmaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A paupeng mi, thu mot gengen mi, le mi sol thei mi tampi zong om a, a diehdiehin tep kitan mite lahah tam deu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />amate pen a sip dide ding uhi, a zieh pen amate in a dih lo sum nga nadingin hil dinga a kilawm lo thute hilin, innkuon buppi a buoisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate lahah a kamsang pa khat in, “Crete gam mite pen zuouphuo dente, gamsa gilo, a thasie le a gongsante ahi uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami teci panna pen a man ahi hi. Bangzieh ahei cile upna lamah a maan nading ule,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jew mite’ tangmite le thuman thutah a nielte’ thupiehte a thudon lo nadingun amate khautahin phawhsie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A siengtho mite adingin na zosie siengtho a, hinanle a kisiete le thu um lo mite adingin a siengtho khat zong om lo hi. Amau’ lungsim mama le a kitheina lungsim uh a kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien thei a kinei vua, ahi vangin a gamtatna utawh ama a nuol uhi. Amate pen a mudahuoi, thu mang lo, nasep hoi khatpo sem dinga a kilawm lo mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang na hile thuhilna man tawh kituohin thu na hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasal khanghamte pen a kideh zo mi, a zatah huoi mi, a pilvang mi, upna man a nei mi, itna a nei mi, le thuoh zawhna a nei mi ahi nadingun na gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ma bangin numei khanghamte zong a gamtatna uh zatah baang mi, mi gensie lo mi, zu’ sila a suoh lo mi ahi nadingun na gen in; amate in thu a hil ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaci’n nupilate in a pasalte le a tate uh a it nadingun hanthawnin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien’ thu a kigensiet lo nadingin amau le amau a ki-uh thei, a gamtat siengtho, inn sung vaihawm siem mi, a migi, le a pasalte thu a mang mi a suo nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ma bangin pasal khangdawngte in a pumpi uh a ki-uh zo ciet nadingun hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang mama in sil bangkimah gamtat hoina limpha na lah inlen, na thuhilna ah citahna le zatah huoina lahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a kimawsah thei lo thutah na zang in; tua hile ei langpan mite in ei gensiet nading uh bangma thu mu loin a maizum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Silate in a pute uh thu mang a, sil bangkimah amate a lungkimsah thei nading uh gen in; amate selkia loin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a nate uzong guhdappieh loin sil bangkimah i hundam pa uh Pasien’ thuhilna a etlawmsah ahi thei nadingun a kicing le a bukim a muonhuoina uh a kilahsah thei nadingun gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mi zosie tunga hutdamna thu a puoh Pasien’ hepina ang kilang zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua hepina in Pasien zatah lona le leitung cilesa deigawnate paimang dingin eite ei hil a, tuhun leitungah i pumpi ki-uh zo-in, thutang le Pasien zataha i hin nadingin ei hil kawmin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a lien i Pasien le i hundam pa Jesu Khris vanglien tahin ang kilah nading a manpha lametna ngahin i om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in eite gitlona zosie panin ei tankhie-in ama’ neituom mite ei sienthosah nading le nasep hoi i sep nop nadingin eite adingin amama ang kipumpieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami thute gen inlen, thuneina zosie tawh hanthawnin phawhsie in. Koima’ simmaw-in om sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in gam-uhte le thuneite’ thu mangin, sil hoi zosie sem dingin a baisa-in a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />koima tungah kamsie ham loin mi tawh kihau kisel ding a pelh nading ule nunnemin mi vannuoi tungah gamtat khuoheh hoi a lah thei nading uh amate na phawhsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite mama zong hun khat lai-in mi mawlawm, thu mang lo, a lampiel mangte, cilesa lunggulna le nopsahna tuomtuomte’ sila i na hi ngai vua, eite in gitlona le hazatna sungah i hun i nite zangin, mite in ei muda a, eite khatlekhat zong a kimuda ngaite i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin i Hundam pa uh Pasien’ migitna le itna ang kilaa tah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />eite sepsa dihna khatpo zieh hi loin, tui tawh suokiana le Hlagau Siengtho zieha thasuona tungtawnin, ama’ ei khuotuona hang tawh ama in eite ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in i Hundam pa Jesu Khris tungtawnin eite tungah tua Hlagau siengtho cingtahin ang sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua pen ama’ hepina tawh eite dih ei kitangsah a, i lamet uh ahi kumtawn hinna tawh kizui-in gouluote i suo nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam thu kigen pen a man ahi hi. Pasien a umsa mite in kidawm taha nasep hoi sem dinga amau le amau a kipumpieh thei nadingun amate in tami thute a thupisim ding uh ka dei hi; tam thu teng pen mi zosie adingin sil hoi tungtuong pen le sil phatuom pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin a mot huoi kiselnate, khangsimnate, kihaunate le thukham vai-a kiselnate na pel in, azieh pen tua thute in phattuomna le kimanna a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kikhen nading a piengsah mi poma khatvei ahi sihle nivei thu na hil zaw ciengin na thudon nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bang mite pen a kisiesa mi le mawna tawh a kidim mi ahi a, ama le ama a kimawpai ahi lam na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artemas ahiei, Tychicus ahiei na kunga kang sawl ciengin Nicopolis khuo ka kungah nang haw thei nadingin hing hanciem ta’n, bangzieh ahei cile khumnah phalbi sung a tam dingin ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuolzinna lamkalah bangma tasap nei lo dingin upadi siempa Zenas le Apollos-te na hi thei za-in na hu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mite ommawh loin tasap awnghu thei ding le nasep hoite sem dinga amau le amau a kipieh nadingun na kisin pelmaw uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima tawh a om mi zosie in nang ang noset uhi. Upna sungah ei it mite ei na noset pieh in. Note zosie tungah hepina hing om taheh.
  </para>
</usx>
